GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活

### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  //"title": "",
  "title": "ポートフォリオのデザインを整える",
  "category": "デザイン",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/11

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "ポートフォリオのデザインを仕上げる",
  "detail": "トップページを見直す",
  "category": "デザイン",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/17


### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### 7. 応募書類を整える
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "履歴書と職務経歴書を見直す",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 1,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-04"
}

### 8. 面接の準備をする
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "志望動機と自己PRをまとめる",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-04"
}

### 9. 応募先を調べる
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "企業研究をして質問を考える",
  "category": "就職活動",
  "priority": 3,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-04"
}

### 10. MCPの窓口を確かめる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp


### 11. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}